style","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":9,"created_at":"2026-07-12T09:29:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-14T19:04:25Z","closed_at":"2026-07-14T17:02:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121262","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121262","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121262.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121262.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-14T17:02:13Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nC++ allows `const` qualifiers on either side of the type name:\r\n\r\n```c++\r\nconst int a = 0;\r\n// is equivalent to\r\nint const a = 1;\r\n```\r\n\r\nIn the parts of the codebase that I know, we usually use left qualifier alignment (the former). I think for readability and consistency purposes it is a good practice to stick with one style.\r\n\r\nIn https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120891 I noticed right qualifier alignment being used. I don't think it is reasonable to expect reviewers to catch this all the time.\r\n\r\nClang format can enforce this for us using the `QualifierAlignment` rule, thus reducing stuff reviewers have to pay attention to.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nSeeing that a lot of code that is currently in violation of this rule comes from platform code that I don't interact with, I'm more than happy to drop this PR if some maintainer says they prefer another style in their area. In that case I might look into enabling the rule exclusively for the GDScript module.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121262/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121262/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}